 CBLife args;id;leaf;step;geom;r;c;pg;n
⍝ Shared callback for DemoLife, dispatched on the source's leaf name:
⍝   TICK/STEP - advance one generation and repaint
⍝   PF        - playfield MouseDown: toggle the clicked cell
⍝   RUN       - check-button: timer Active follows its State
⍝   CLEAR     - empty the board, stop the timer
⍝   RANDOM    - ~35% random fill
⍝   SPEED     - Scroll slider: Timer Interval ← 50×(16-value)
⍝ Board LIFE_B (30x40 boolean) and LIFE_G live in #.demo; mutations happen
⍝ in this tradfn body. Repaint is one multi-prop eWS on the CELLS Rect.

 step←{↑1 ⍵∨.∧3 4=+/,¯1 0 1∘.⊖¯1 0 1∘.⌽⊂⍵}  ⍝ the classic toroidal Life idiom

 geom←{                                      ⍝ boolean board → (Points Size) of alive cells
     idx←⍸⍵
     0=≢idx:((,0)(,0))((,0)(,0))             ⍝ zero-size guard so Points is never empty
     yv←10×¯1+⊃¨idx
     xv←10×¯1+2⊃¨idx
     (yv xv)(((≢yv)⍴10)((≢yv)⍴10))
 }

 id←⊃args
 leaf←{(1-(⌽⍵)⍳'.')↑⍵}id

 :Trap 0
     :Select leaf
     :Case 'TICK'
         LIFE_B←step LIFE_B ⋄ LIFE_G+←1
         →PAINT
     :Case 'STEP'
         LIFE_B←step LIFE_B ⋄ LIFE_G+←1
         →PAINT
     :Case 'PF'                              ⍝ args: id 'MouseDown' y x button shift
         r←1+⌊(3⊃args)÷10 ⋄ c←1+⌊(4⊃args)÷10
         :If (r≤30)∧c≤40
             LIFE_B[r;c]←~LIFE_B[r;c]
         :EndIf
         →PAINT
     :Case 'RUN'
         'F1.TICK'eWS'Active'(id eWG'State')
         →0
     :Case 'CLEAR'
         LIFE_B←30 40⍴0 ⋄ LIFE_G←0
         'F1.TICK'eWS'Active' 0
         'F1.RUN'eWS'State' 0
         →PAINT
     :Case 'RANDOM'
         LIFE_B←0.35>?30 40⍴0 ⋄ LIFE_G←0
         →PAINT
     :Case 'SPEED'                           ⍝ args: id 'Scroll' direction value
         'F1.TICK'eWS'Interval'(50×16-4⊃args)
         →0
     :EndSelect
     →0
PAINT:
     pg←geom LIFE_B
     n←≢⊃⊃pg
     'F1.PF.CELLS'eWS('Points'(⊃pg))('Size'(2⊃pg))('FStyle'(n⍴0))   ⍝ FStyle 0 = solid fill
     'F1.GEN'eWS'Caption'('Gen: ',⍕LIFE_G)
     'F1.POP'eWS'Caption'('Pop: ',⍕+/,LIFE_B)
 :Else
     ⎕←'CBLife: ',(⊃⎕DM),' (likely a late Timer tick after a demo switch)'
 :EndTrap
